 "description": "Parses loot messages as the game prints them, one per line, such as \"12:34 Loot of a dragon: 2 small diamonds, a steel shield (active prey bonus).\" It reads in-game names, not wiki titles. Gives totals by item with count and value, and entries it cannot resolve. Prices are NPC prices in gold, coins at face value. Other lines come back unparsed. Both lists stop at 100, their counts in totals do not.",
